  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p>Whenever a ranged weapon attack would be made against a dancer (except for unusually massive ranged weapons), they may spend an immediate action to attempt to dodge the attack. The dancer attempts a Perform (dance) check using your associated modifier, comparing the result against the ranged attack roll. If the check is greater than the attack roll, it deals no damage. The dancer must be aware of the attack and not be flat-footed.</p>\n<p>You may take this talent a second time. If you do, whenever a dancer would negate an attack, they may instead reflect the ranged attack back at the original attacker, using the original attack roll at a -2 penalty for the attempt.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
